Package: diffuR
Type: Package
Title: Lightweight Diffusion Models in R with Rcpp and torch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Your", family = "Name", role = c("aut","cre"), email = "you@example.com"))
Description: Minimal diffusion probabilistic models (DDPM) and score-based SDE samplers for low-dimensional distributions and small images. 
    Core Gaussian kernels are implemented in C++ via RcppArmadillo, with models trained using torch for R. 
    Includes distribution and image examples, and optional parallel evaluation with foreach/doParallel.
